{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「2026 TIMA國際音樂大賞」（TMElive International Music Awards）第二場今日在啟德舉行，雲集多組海內外一線頂尖藝人與K-Pop天團。第二日地毯盛會，由JYP娛樂七人男團KickFlip打頭陣，接住是短短出道四個月的女團UNCHILD等陸續登場。在內地人氣不俗的陳偉霆未有現身紅地毯。</p><p>紅地毯盛況：</p><p>IVE靚爆登場</p><p>紅地毯盛況：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1048952/block/singleImage/3187387/wm/01M0PW7CQSH9JG9KH7SNH3KWWB.jpeg?updatedAt=1787475162\"/><figcaption>EVAN</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1048952/block/singleImage/3187388/wm/01M0PW9ZYSYN737YR928KAY1WG.jpeg?updatedAt=1787475162\"/><figcaption>AND2BLE</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1048952/block/singleImage/3187389/wm/01M0PWDCDE19JRJCEDXQFWDB9H.jpeg?updatedAt=1787475162\"/><figcaption>NCT WISH</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1048952/block/singleImage/3187390/wm/01M0PWF4TJ7W5PH3CFST41S332.jpeg?updatedAt=1787475162\"/><figcaption>NMIXX</figcaption></figure><p>Stray Kids</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T09:19:05.198221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":4,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}